  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Changes since 8.0.0 Preview 2\n* Removed .NET Standard 2.0 support\n* Improved code formatting\n* Clarified unsupported Operating Systems for Process ``HasStarted`` extension method\n* Added new string ``Insert(int index, char c)`` extension method\n* Fixed an issue with ``ToTitleCase`` method - 7.6.x is not affected.\n* Moved Integer Range enumerable and array methods to ExtraLinq\n* Moved Span non-predicate First and Last extension methods to ExtraLinq\n* Fixed an issue with Range ``AsRange`` extension methods not providing the correct range - Backported to 7.6.4\n* Other optimisations and improvements\n\n### MsExtensions only\n* Renamed StringSegment ``ToList`` method to ``AsList`` \n* Improve whitespace detection in StringSegment ``IsNullOrWhiteSpace`` extension method",
